{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50498","headline":"道情诗 · 王梵志","name":"道情诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我昔未生时，冥冥无所知。\n天公强生我，生我复何爲？\n无衣使我寒，无食使我饥。\n还你天公我，还我未生时。\n（此首唐释皎然《诗式》卷一《跌宕格二品·骇俗》中引之，郑辑本未收。\n）（〖1〗《全唐诗编剧补遗》卷二据《云溪友议》收此诗，今删去。\n异文录如次：首句作「天公未生我」，三句「强」作「忽」，五句「使」作「遣」，六句「使」作「遣」，六句「使」作「令」，七句「你」作「尔」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50498.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50498","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}